154
00:07:47,740 --> 00:07:50,960
The chef, a part African-American, part Native American man,

155
00:07:51,060 --> 00:07:53,560
named George Crumb, was less than pleased.

156
00:07:53,660 --> 00:07:55,660
And his reaction made history.

157
00:07:55,760 --> 00:08:00,000
George Crumb decided to shave them as thin as he could get,

158
00:08:00,001 --> 00:08:03,800
fried them and sort of turned them into potato chips.

159
00:08:03,900 --> 00:08:07,000
The legend continues that much to Chef Crumb's dismay,

160
00:08:07,100 --> 00:08:09,200
