161
00:08:09,300 --> 00:08:11,340
The customers loved the crispy snacks,

162
00:08:11,440 --> 00:08:13,140
and he wasn't the only one.

163
00:08:13,240 --> 00:08:16,240
These new Saratoga chips became an instant hit

164
00:08:16,340 --> 00:08:19,560
in Saratoga Springs and spread throughout the country.

165
00:08:20,580 --> 00:08:22,920
Between the 1920s and 1930s,

166
