583
00:30:52,121 --> 00:30:55,120
Richard Montañez was the son of Mexican immigrants,

584
00:30:55,121 --> 00:30:59,760
of Mexican immigrants, and in 1976, he was 18 years old,

585
00:30:59,761 --> 00:31:03,400
