594
00:31:22,781 --> 00:31:26,040
Richard Montañez was inspired by the flavors that he grew up eating,

595
00:31:26,500 --> 00:31:29,420
particularly of the Mexican street corn or the Mexican elote,

596
00:31:29,640 --> 00:31:34,860
with flavors of chili powder and cheese and, of course, lots of lime.

597
00:31:35,660 --> 00:31:37,580
When he got a flavor he was proud of,

598
00:31:37,980 --> 00:31:41,480
Richard mustered up the courage to call the CEO of the company

599
00:31:41,481 --> 00:31:44,820
and pitched his new spicy flavor of Cheeto.

600
00:31:45,260 --> 00:31:50,180
