601
00:31:50,181 --> 00:31:53,180
The head of Frito-Lay invited Richard Montanez

602
00:31:53,181 --> 00:31:56,180
to pitch his new flavor of Cheeto to the board.

603
00:31:56,181 --> 00:31:59,180
Of course, they were blown away,

604
00:31:59,181 --> 00:32:02,180
